{"seq":3,"slug":"graphics-and-canvas","title":"图形与 Canvas 绘制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/graphics-and-canvas","wordCount":522,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"图形与-canvas-绘制\">图形与 Canvas 绘制</h1><p>当标准组件无法满足视觉需求——自定义图表、粒子效果、手势绘图、游戏画面——你需要直接操作 Compose 的绘制层。<code>Canvas</code> composable 和 <code>DrawScope</code> API 提供了像素级的绘制能力，同时保持与 Compose 响应式模型的无缝集成：状态变化自动触发重绘，无需手动 <code>invalidate()</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 的绘制系统分为三个阶段：Composition → Layout → Drawing。<code>Canvas</code> composable 跳过了前两个阶段中的大部分工作（无子节点组合、无复杂测量），直接在 Drawing 阶段通过 <code>DrawScope</code> 执行绘制命令。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Composition 阶段] --&gt; B[Layout 阶段]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Drawing 阶段]&#10;    C --&gt; D[DrawScope]&#10;    D --&gt; E[drawLine / drawCircle / drawPath...]&#10;    D --&gt; F[drawIntoCanvas → 原生 Canvas API]&#10;&#10;    subgraph DrawScope 提供&#10;        G[size: Size]&#10;        H[center: Offset]&#10;        I[drawContext: DrawContext]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[Composition 阶段] --&gt; B[Layout 阶段]\n    B --&gt; C[Drawing 阶段]\n    C --&gt; D[DrawScope]\n    D --&gt; E[drawLine / drawCircle / drawPath...]\n    D --&gt; F[drawIntoCanvas → 原生 Canvas API]\n\n    subgraph DrawScope 提供\n        G[size: Size]\n        H[center: Offset]\n        I[drawContext: DrawContext]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>API 层级</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Canvas</code> composable</td>\n<td>独立的纯绘制区域</td>\n<td>图表、仪表盘、签名板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Modifier.drawBehind {}</code></td>\n<td>在现有组件背后绘制</td>\n<td>自定义背景、阴影</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Modifier.drawWithContent {}</code></td>\n<td>控制绘制顺序（前/后/替代）</td>\n<td>遮罩、渐变叠加</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Modifier.drawWithCache {}</code></td>\n<td>缓存绘制中间产物</td>\n<td>复杂 Path、Brush 预计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>drawIntoCanvas {}</code></td>\n<td>访问平台原生 Canvas</td>\n<td>使用 Android Canvas 专属 API</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"canvas-基础绘制\">Canvas 基础绘制</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun PieChart(&#10;    data: List&lt;PieSlice&gt;,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier&#10;) {&#10;    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(200.dp)) {&#10;        val total = data.sumOf { it.value.toDouble() }.toFloat()&#10;        var startAngle = -90f  // 从 12 点钟方向开始&#10;&#10;        data.forEach { slice -&gt;&#10;            val sweepAngle = 360f * slice.value / total&#10;            drawArc(&#10;                color = slice.color,&#10;                startAngle = startAngle,&#10;                sweepAngle = sweepAngle,&#10;                useCenter = true,&#10;                size = size&#10;            )&#10;            startAngle += sweepAngle&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;data class PieSlice(val label: String, val value: Float, val color: Color)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun PieChart(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data: List&#x3C;PieSlice>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(200.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val total = data.sumOf { it.value.toDouble() }.toFloat()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        var startAngle = -90f  // 从 12 点钟方向开始</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        data.forEach { slice -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val sweepAngle = 360f * slice.value / total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            drawArc(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                color = slice.color,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                startAngle = startAngle,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                sweepAngle = sweepAngle,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                useCenter = true,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                size = size</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            startAngle += sweepAngle</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class PieSlice(val label: String, val value: Float, val color: Color)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"path-绘制与贝塞尔曲线\">Path 绘制与贝塞尔曲线</h2><p><code>Path</code> 是构建复杂形状的基础——折线图、波浪背景、自定义形状裁剪都依赖它：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun LineChart(&#10;    points: List&lt;Float&gt;,&#10;    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,&#10;    lineColor: Color = Color(0xFF6200EE)&#10;) {&#10;    Canvas(modifier = modifier.fillMaxWidth().height(200.dp)) {&#10;        if (points.size &lt; 2) return@Canvas&#10;&#10;        val maxValue = points.max()&#10;        val minValue = points.min()&#10;        val range = (maxValue - minValue).coerceAtLeast(1f)&#10;&#10;        val stepX = size.width / (points.size - 1)&#10;&#10;        val path = Path().apply {&#10;            points.forEachIndexed { index, value -&gt;&#10;                val x = index * stepX&#10;                val y = size.height * (1 - (value - minValue) / range)&#10;                if (index == 0) moveTo(x, y) else lineTo(x, y)&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        // 绘制折线&#10;        drawPath(&#10;            path = path,&#10;            color = lineColor,&#10;            style = Stroke(width = 3.dp.toPx(), cap = StrokeCap.Round)&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        // 绘制面积填充（渐变）&#10;        val fillPath = Path().apply {&#10;            addPath(path)&#10;            lineTo(size.width, size.height)&#10;            lineTo(0f, size.height)&#10;            close()&#10;        }&#10;        drawPath(&#10;            path = fillPath,&#10;            brush = Brush.verticalGradient(&#10;                colors = listOf(lineColor.copy(alpha = 0.3f), Color.Transparent)&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun LineChart(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    points: List&#x3C;Float>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    modifier: Modifier = Modifier,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lineColor: Color = Color(0xFF6200EE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Canvas(modifier = modifier.fillMaxWidth().height(200.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if (points.size &#x3C; 2) return@Canvas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val maxValue = points.max()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val minValue = points.min()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val range = (maxValue - minValue).coerceAtLeast(1f)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val stepX = size.width / (points.size - 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val path = Path().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            points.forEachIndexed { index, value -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val x = index * stepX</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val y = size.height * (1 - (value - minValue) / range)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                if (index == 0) moveTo(x, y) else lineTo(x, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 绘制折线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawPath(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            path = path,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            color = lineColor,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            style = Stroke(width = 3.dp.toPx(), cap = StrokeCap.Round)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 绘制面积填充（渐变）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val fillPath = Path().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            addPath(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lineTo(size.width, size.height)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            lineTo(0f, size.height)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawPath(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            path = fillPath,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            brush = Brush.verticalGradient(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                colors = listOf(lineColor.copy(alpha = 0.3f), Color.Transparent)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"drawwithcache-性能关键\">drawWithCache：性能关键</h2><p>频繁重绘时（如动画），在每帧重新创建 <code>Path</code>、<code>Paint</code>、<code>Brush</code> 等对象会增加 GC 压力。<code>drawWithCache</code> 让你在参数不变时复用这些中间产物：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun AnimatedWave(phase: Float, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    Spacer(&#10;        modifier = modifier&#10;            .fillMaxWidth()&#10;            .height(100.dp)&#10;            .drawWithCache {&#10;                // 这个块只在 size 变化时重新执行&#10;                val wavePath = Path()&#10;                val waveHeight = size.height * 0.3f&#10;&#10;                onDrawBehind {&#10;                    // 这个块每帧执行，但复用外层缓存的对象&#10;                    wavePath.reset()&#10;                    wavePath.moveTo(0f, size.height / 2)&#10;&#10;                    var x = 0f&#10;                    while (x &lt; size.width) {&#10;                        val y = size.height / 2 +&#10;                            waveHeight * sin((x / size.width * 4 * PI + phase).toFloat())&#10;                        wavePath.lineTo(x, y)&#10;                        x += 2f&#10;                    }&#10;&#10;                    drawPath(&#10;                        path = wavePath,&#10;                        color = Color(0xFF03DAC5),&#10;                        style = Stroke(width = 3.dp.toPx())&#10;                    )&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;    )&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun AnimatedWave(phase: Float, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Spacer(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        modifier = modifier</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .fillMaxWidth()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .height(100.dp)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .drawWithCache {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 这个块只在 size 变化时重新执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val wavePath = Path()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                val waveHeight = size.height * 0.3f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                onDrawBehind {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    // 这个块每帧执行，但复用外层缓存的对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    wavePath.reset()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    wavePath.moveTo(0f, size.height / 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    var x = 0f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    while (x &#x3C; size.width) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        val y = size.height / 2 +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            waveHeight * sin((x / size.width * 4 * PI + phase).toFloat())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        wavePath.lineTo(x, y)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        x += 2f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    drawPath(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        path = wavePath,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        color = Color(0xFF03DAC5),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        style = Stroke(width = 3.dp.toPx())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"blendmode-与图层\">BlendMode 与图层</h2><p>Compose 的 <code>BlendMode</code> 支持 Porter-Duff 混合模式，配合 <code>graphicsLayer</code> 可实现镂空、叠加等高级效果：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun TextMask(text: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(300.dp, 100.dp)) {&#10;        // 先绘制渐变背景&#10;        drawRect(&#10;            brush = Brush.horizontalGradient(&#10;                colors = listOf(Color(0xFFFF6B6B), Color(0xFF4ECDC4))&#10;            )&#10;        )&#10;        // 用 DstOut 模式镂空文字区域&#10;        drawContext.canvas.nativeCanvas.apply {&#10;            val paint = android.graphics.Paint().apply {&#10;                textSize = 80f&#10;                typeface = android.graphics.Typeface.DEFAULT_BOLD&#10;                xfermode = android.graphics.PorterDuffXfermode(&#10;                    android.graphics.PorterDuff.Mode.DST_OUT&#10;                )&#10;            }&#10;            drawText(text, 20f, 70f, paint)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun TextMask(text: String, modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(300.dp, 100.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 先绘制渐变背景</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawRect(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            brush = Brush.horizontalGradient(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                colors = listOf(Color(0xFFFF6B6B), Color(0xFF4ECDC4))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        // 用 DstOut 模式镂空文字区域</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawContext.canvas.nativeCanvas.apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            val paint = android.graphics.Paint().apply {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                textSize = 80f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                typeface = android.graphics.Typeface.DEFAULT_BOLD</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                xfermode = android.graphics.PorterDuffXfermode(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    android.graphics.PorterDuff.Mode.DST_OUT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            drawText(text, 20f, 70f, paint)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"与动画系统集成\">与动画系统集成</h2><p>绘制天然适合与 <code>Animatable</code>/<code>animate*AsState</code> 配合：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Composable&#10;fun PulsingDot(modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {&#10;    val infiniteTransition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = &quot;pulse&quot;)&#10;    val scale by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(&#10;        initialValue = 0.8f,&#10;        targetValue = 1.2f,&#10;        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(&#10;            animation = tween(800, easing = FastOutSlowInEasing),&#10;            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse&#10;        ),&#10;        label = &quot;scale&quot;&#10;    )&#10;    val alpha by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(&#10;        initialValue = 1f,&#10;        targetValue = 0.4f,&#10;        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(&#10;            animation = tween(800),&#10;            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse&#10;        ),&#10;        label = &quot;alpha&quot;&#10;    )&#10;&#10;    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(48.dp)) {&#10;        drawCircle(&#10;            color = Color(0xFF6200EE).copy(alpha = alpha),&#10;            radius = size.minDimension / 2 * scale&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Composable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fun PulsingDot(modifier: Modifier = Modifier) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val infiniteTransition = rememberInfiniteTransition(label = \"pulse\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val scale by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initialValue = 0.8f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetValue = 1.2f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            animation = tween(800, easing = FastOutSlowInEasing),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"scale\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val alpha by infiniteTransition.animateFloat(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initialValue = 1f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        targetValue = 0.4f,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        animationSpec = infiniteRepeatable(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            animation = tween(800),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repeatMode = RepeatMode.Reverse</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        label = \"alpha\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Canvas(modifier = modifier.size(48.dp)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        drawCircle(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            color = Color(0xFF6200EE).copy(alpha = alpha),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            radius = size.minDimension / 2 * scale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>Canvas</code> composable 提供纯绘制区域，<code>DrawScope</code> 是所有绘制命令的执行环境</li>\n<li><code>drawWithCache</code> 在参数不变时缓存中间产物（Path、Brush），避免每帧重建</li>\n<li><code>Modifier.drawBehind/drawWithContent</code> 让任何组件都能附加自定义绘制逻辑</li>\n<li>Path + 贝塞尔曲线是构建图表、波浪、不规则形状的核心工具</li>\n<li>BlendMode 配合图层实现镂空、叠加等混合效果</li>\n<li>绘制参数绑定到 <code>animate*AsState</code>/<code>InfiniteTransition</code> 即可实现流畅动画</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"custom-layout\">自定义布局</a>——布局阶段如何决定绘制区域的位置与大小</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../android-development/jetpack-compose/animation\">Android 开发基础 · 动画</a>——Compose 动画系统的基础 API</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../kotlin-advanced/functional-patterns/higher-order-functions\">Kotlin 进阶 · 高阶函数</a>——DrawScope 扩展函数的设计模式</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图形与 Canvas 绘制","id":"图形与-canvas-绘制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Canvas 基础绘制","id":"canvas-基础绘制"},{"level":2,"text":"Path 绘制与贝塞尔曲线","id":"path-绘制与贝塞尔曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"drawWithCache：性能关键","id":"drawwithcache-性能关键"},{"level":2,"text":"BlendMode 与图层","id":"blendmode-与图层"},{"level":2,"text":"与动画系统集成","id":"与动画系统集成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"LazyLayout 内部机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/ui/lazy-layout-internals"},"next":{"title":"副作用与生命周期","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-jetpack-compose/architecture/side-effects-lifecycle"}}